%N A015483 Inverse of 1474th cyclotomic polynomial.
%C A015483 Periodic with period length 1474. - _Ray Chandler_, Apr 07 2017
%H A015483 Ray Chandler, <a href="/A015483/b015483.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..2000</a>
%H A015483 <a href="/index/Per#periodic">Index entries for periodic sequences</a>, period 1474.
%H A015483 <a href="/index/Rec#order_660">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, order 660.
%H A015483 <a href="/index/Pol#poly_cyclo_inv">Index to sequences related to inverse of cyclotomic polynomials</a>
%p A015483 with(numtheory,cyclotomic); c := n->series(1/cyclotomic(n,x),x,80);
%t A015483 Module[{x, nmax = 100}, PadRight[CoefficientList[Series[1/Cyclotomic[1474, x], {x, 0, nmax}], x], nmax + 1]] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Oct 07 2026 *)
%o A015483 (PARI) first(n)=Vec(1/polcyclo(1474)+O(x^(n+1))) \\ _Charles R Greathouse IV_, Jun 01 2026
%K A015483 sign,easy,changed
%O A015483 0,1
%A A015483 _Simon Plouffe_
